@startuml ABU-SSO OIDC Login and Service Access
title ABU-SSO — Central Login, OIDC SSO and Service Session
actor User
participant Browser
participant "Campus Service\n(OIDC Client)" as Service
participant "Central ABU-SSO\n(IdP)" as IdP
database "Neon PostgreSQL\n(IdP sessions and audit)" as DB
== 1. Open a protected campus service ==
User -> Browser: Open protected service URL
Browser -> Service: GET protected resource
Service -> Service: Check service-local session
alt No valid service-local session
  Service --> Browser: Redirect to IdP /authorize\n(state, nonce, PKCE challenge)
  Browser -> IdP: GET /authorize
  IdP -> DB: Find active abu_idp_session
  alt No active central IdP session
    IdP --> Browser: Redirect to /login
    User -> Browser: Enter matric/staff number and password
    Browser -> IdP: POST /auth/login
    IdP -> DB: Verify user and create IdP session
    DB --> IdP: Session created
    IdP --> Browser: Set HttpOnly abu_idp_session cookie
    Browser -> IdP: Resume authorization request
  else Active central IdP session
    DB --> IdP: Active session and user
  end
  IdP -> DB: Record authorization event
  IdP --> Browser: Redirect to registered callback\nwith authorization code
  Browser -> Service: GET /auth/callback?code=...
  Service -> IdP: POST /token\n(code + PKCE verifier)
  IdP --> Service: OIDC tokens
  Service -> Service: Validate OIDC response and create local session
  Service --> Browser: Redirect to protected service
else Service-local session exists
  Service -> IdP: Revalidate central IdP session
  IdP -> DB: Check session active / revoked / expired
  alt Central session valid
    DB --> IdP: Active session
    IdP --> Service: Authorization remains valid
  else Central session invalid
    IdP --> Service: Revalidation denied
    Service --> Browser: Clear local session and redirect to IdP
  end
end
== 2. Central logout ==
User -> Browser: Click Log out at central dashboard
Browser -> IdP: POST /auth/logout
IdP -> DB: Revoke IdP session
DB --> IdP: Revocation committed
IdP --> Browser: Clear abu_idp_session cookie
Browser -> Browser: Remove central dashboard API token
Browser --> User: Redirect to /login
note over Service,IdP
Each campus service has its own local session.
A local session must not bypass central IdP
authorization after central logout or expiry.
end note
@enduml
